From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:58:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: generic-plat: Add the Allwinner A733

The DWC3 controller of the A733 needs five clocks and its reset handled
before the core can be probed, two of the clocks being bus gates in the
SERDES CCU. The generic platform glue does exactly that, so add the A733
compatible to it.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; 6a00000.usb binds to
dwc3-generic-plat once the PHYs are loaded, the core comes out of reset,
and it survives two unbind and bind cycles in both plug orientations.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-generic-plat.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-generic-plat.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-generic-plat.c
index ca69ac0eb07c..06efd29a0f99 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-generic-plat.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-generic-plat.c
@@ -232,6 +232,7 @@ static const struct dwc3_generic_config eic7700_dwc3 =  {
 };
 
 static const struct of_device_id dwc3_generic_of_match[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-dwc3", },
 	{ .compatible = "spacemit,k1-dwc3", &spacemit_k1_dwc3},
 	{ .compatible = "spacemit,k3-dwc3", },
 	{ .compatible = "fsl,ls1028a-dwc3", &fsl_ls1028_dwc3},
